      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "ComfyUI-Pixaroma",
        "ver": "fc17bd2b58ef0089cc62a40502669cf71ae86db7",
        "Node name for S&R": "PixaromaPauseText",
        "pauseTextState": {
          "gate": "pause",
          "text": "A Pixar-style 3D render of a cute cartoon bunny, rendered with soft, rounded edges and expressive eyes, stands in the center of a fantasy forest. The bunny is white, fluffy, and adorable, with oversized ears slightly twitching as if curious or alert. It wears an orange t-shirt, its fabric smooth and slightly textured, with the word “PIXA” printed boldly across the chest in crisp white letters, each stroke clear and evenly spaced. The bunny gazes directly at the camera with wide, innocent eyes that sparkle with gentle curiosity.\n\nThe forest surrounds it with towering mushroom-like trees, their caps wide and capriciously shaped in earthy browns and muted purples, stems curling upward like whimsical pillars. Leaves dangle from branches in soft greens and golds, catching morning light that filters through the canopy in warm, golden beams. Sunlight glows gently on the bunny’s fur, highlighting its softness and giving depth to the scene.\n\nThe foreground features mossy ground underfoot, richly textured and tinged with green and amber. The background fades into dreamy, hazy depths, with distant glowing leaves and floating dewdrops catching the light. The entire image has a painterly Pixar glow—smooth surfaces, volumetric lighting, and a shallow depth of field that keeps the bunny sharply focused while softly blurring the surrounding wonderland. The mood is serene, whimsical, and full of quiet enchantment.",
          "original": "A Pixar-style 3D render of a cute cartoon bunny, rendered with soft, rounded edges and expressive eyes, stands in the center of a fantasy forest. The bunny is white, fluffy, and adorable, with oversized ears slightly twitching as if curious or alert. It wears an orange t-shirt, its fabric smooth and slightly textured, with the word “PIXA” printed boldly across the chest in crisp white letters, each stroke clear and evenly spaced. The bunny gazes directly at the camera with wide, innocent eyes that sparkle with gentle curiosity.\n\nThe forest surrounds it with towering mushroom-like trees, their caps wide and capriciously shaped in earthy browns and muted purples, stems curling upward like whimsical pillars. Leaves dangle from branches in soft greens and golds, catching morning light that filters through the canopy in warm, golden beams. Sunlight glows gently on the bunny’s fur, highlighting its softness and giving depth to the scene.\n\nThe foreground features mossy ground underfoot, richly textured and tinged with green and amber. The background fades into dreamy, hazy depths, with distant glowing leaves and floating dewdrops catching the light. The entire image has a painterly Pixar glow—smooth surfaces, volumetric lighting, and a shallow depth of field that keeps the bunny sharply focused while softly blurring the surrounding wonderland. The mood is serene, whimsical, and full of quiet enchantment."
        }
